    "Adds macOS 15+ Apple Silicon support with an offline DMG, runtime and BGE-M3 model."
  ],
  "improvements": [
    "Linux x86_64 AppImage, Windows x64 Setup, macOS ARM64 DMG and Docker AMD64 share version 1.1.3.",
    "macOS includes the Remember Me application icon and normal quit/restart support."
  ],
